Hi,

I guess that the problem is that your individuals in your genlight object do not have a population assigned.
As mentioned in the information provided in the heading of this forum, you can use the function  gl.compliance.check() as shown below:

library(dartR)
t1 <- platypus.gl <http://platypus.gl>
t1$pop <- NULL
t1 <- gl.compliance.check(t1)
pcoa <- gl.pcoa(t1)
gl.pcoa.plot(pcoa,t1)

Cheers,
Luis

